ext":"Three experiments have the same low acceptance score, yet","startMs":23520,"endMs":26620},{"text":"each eliminates a different explanation for a slowdown.","startMs":26620,"endMs":30160},{"text":"Stopping solely because the score is flat could discard","startMs":30160,"endMs":32960},{"text":"useful learning.","startMs":32960,"endMs":34920},{"text":"A canceled deployment is our third case.","startMs":34920,"endMs":37500},{"text":"The latest tests pass, but the user withdrew permission","startMs":37500,"endMs":40160},{"text":"while a remote request may already be in flight.","startMs":40160,"endMs":43320},{"text":"A high score cannot erase that cancellation or establish","startMs":43320,"endMs":46180},{"text":"what the receiver did.","startMs":46180,"endMs":48100},{"text":"These are illustrative cases, not measurements of a particular","startMs":48100,"endMs":51500},{"text":"deployed product.","startMs":51500,"endMs":52420},{"text":"Our governing question is: what evidence makes another attempt","startMs":52420,"endMs":56860},{"text":"worthwhile?","startMs":56860,"endMs":58440},{"text":"We will separate hard limits from progress signals, admit","startMs":58440,"endMs":61620},{"text":"actions before spending, recognize cycles, preserve useful partial results,","startMs":61620,"endMs":67200},{"text":"and define valid resumption.","startMs":67200,"endMs":69260},{"text":"By the end, you should be able to stop","startMs":69260,"endMs":71320},{"text":"a loop with an honest explanation of what was","startMs":71320,"endMs":73700},{"text":"achieved, why execution ended, and what specific change could","startMs":73700,"endMs":78100},{"text":"make further work useful.","startMs":78100,"endMs":79420}],"boardEvents":[{"atMs":0,"actionIndex":0},{"atMs":0,"actionIndex":1},{"atMs":18460,"actionIndex":2},{"atMs":21060,"actionIndex":3},{"atMs":34920,"actionIndex":4},{"atMs":52420,"actionIndex":5}],"boardTimingMethod":"authored-spoken-cues-v1"}